@page "/when-the-storm-hits"
<PageTitle>When the storm hits · Tangent Atlas</PageTitle>

<div class="ta-container ta-page">
    <h1 class="ta-visually-hidden">When the storm hits</h1>   @* The menu already names the page; the heading is kept for screen readers and search. *@
    <p class="ta-page-idea">Turn it down. Don’t switch it off.</p>

    <div class="ta-storm-grid">
        <div class="ta-storm-copy">
            <p class="ta-page-sub">Sooner or later, everyone needs cash: a new roof, a lost job, a market that keeps you up at night.</p>
            <p class="ta-page-sub">Take Ken. He likes his job and gets great reviews, but there are rumors going around the office. His best case is ten more years of great paychecks and regular bonuses. His worst case is that the rumors are true.</p>
            <p class="ta-page-sub">Buying a stock is hard. Selling under pressure is harder, because it means giving up on your plan. With Tangent Atlas, turn the dial down. We reduce your holdings according to your plan and raise the cash. Needing cash becomes part of your plan, not the end of it.</p>

        <div class="ta-holdings">
            <div class="ta-holdings-name">Ken today: $420,000 invested, $80,000 in cash</div>
            <div class="ta-holdings-bar" role="img" aria-label="Ken today: JPM $60,000, DIS $40,000, SPY $105,000, 401(k) $95,000, QQQ $120,000, cash $80,000">
                <div class="ta-holdings-seg ta-holdings-c1" style="width: 12%"><b>JPM</b>$60k</div>
                <div class="ta-holdings-seg ta-holdings-c2" style="width: 8%"><b>DIS</b>$40k</div>
                <div class="ta-holdings-seg ta-holdings-c3" style="width: 21%"><b>SPY</b>$105k</div>
                <div class="ta-holdings-seg ta-holdings-read-only" style="width: 19%"><b>401(k)</b>$95k</div>
                <div class="ta-holdings-seg ta-holdings-c4" style="width: 24%"><b>QQQ</b>$120k</div>
                <div class="ta-holdings-seg ta-holdings-cash" style="width: 16%"><b>Cash</b>$80k</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ta-holdings">
            <div class="ta-holdings-name">After Ken turns the dial down: $320,000 invested, $180,000 in cash</div>
            <div class="ta-holdings-bar" role="img" aria-label="After: JPM $41,500, DIS $27,700, SPY $72,700, 401(k) $95,000 unchanged, QQQ $83,100, cash $180,000">
                <div class="ta-holdings-seg ta-holdings-c1" style="width: 8.3%"><b>JPM</b>$42k</div>
                <div class="ta-holdings-seg ta-holdings-c2" style="width: 5.54%"><b>DIS</b>$28k</div>
                <div class="ta-holdings-seg ta-holdings-c3" style="width: 14.54%"><b>SPY</b>$73k</div>
                <div class="ta-holdings-seg ta-holdings-read-only" style="width: 19%"><b>401(k)</b>$95k</div>
                <div class="ta-holdings-seg ta-holdings-c4" style="width: 16.62%"><b>QQQ</b>$83k</div>
                <div class="ta-holdings-seg ta-holdings-cash" style="width: 36%"><b>Cash</b>$180k</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p class="ta-page-sub">The whole house cools together: every holding Ken can trade comes down by the same 31%. His 401(k) is counted, never traded.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ta-storm-dial">
            <svg width="240" height="240" viewBox="0 0 240 240" role="img" aria-label="A round thermostat turned down from 84% invested to 64% invested">
                <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="112" fill="#ffffff" stroke="rgba(0,0,0,0.12)" stroke-width="2"></circle>
                <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="92" fill="none" stroke="#e5e7eb" stroke-width="14" stroke-dasharray="433.5 578" transform="rotate(135 120 120)" stroke-linecap="round"></circle>
                <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="92" fill="none" stroke="#1D9E75" stroke-width="14" stroke-dasharray="277.4 578" transform="rotate(135 120 120)" stroke-linecap="round"></circle>
                <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="70" fill="#f9f9f7"></circle>
                <text x="120" y="122" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Playfair Display, Georgia, serif" font-size="44" fill="#1a1a1a">64%</text>
                <text x="120" y="148" text-anchor="middle" font-family="DM Sans, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#4b5563">invested</text>
                <text x="120" y="168" text-anchor="middle" font-family="DM Sans, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="500" fill="#0F6E56">▼ from 84%</text>
            </svg>
            <div class="ta-storm-dial-caption">You set the temperature.</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="ta-page-statement">Don’t change your plan. Adjust it.</h2>
    <p class="ta-page-sub">When the storm is over, getting back into your positions is as easy as getting out. Just turn the dial back up.</p>

    <div class="ta-page-final">
        <p class="ta-page-close">Respond with discipline, not panic.</p>
        <AuthorizeView>
            <NotAuthorized>
                <a href="/signup" class="ta-btn ta-btn-primary ta-btn-large">Sign up</a>
            </NotAuthorized>
        </AuthorizeView>
    </div>
</div>

<section class="ta-band ta-fineprint">
    <div class="ta-container">
        <p class="ta-figures"><strong>About these figures.</strong> Ken’s 401(k) is counted but never sold, because Tangent Atlas doesn’t trade in employer plans.</p>
    </div>
</section>
